# What the OIDF conformance suite's own scripts/requirements.txt
# (gitlab.com/openid/conformance-suite, at the release pinned in
# scripts/suite-version.env) lists. The conformance workflow installs
# the hash-pinned compilation of this file, requirements-suite.txt,
# never the suite's unpinned list. To refresh it, after checking the
# suite's list still matches this one (check again whenever the suite
# pin moves):
#
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras \
#     --no-emit-index-url --output-file conformance/requirements-suite.txt \
#     conformance/requirements-suite.in
httpx
pyparsing
